  Description: "COMPANION / MYTHIC / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nClockwork Union companions
    gain 8% movement and attack speed per talent. Combined with Intelligent Construct,
    this buff is capped at 25%.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nChampion / Maximum health:
    +3\nChampion / Attack speed: -0.5%\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three
    units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nThey hear dreams
    through a boarding house's walls. They predicted visitors' needs until nobody
    remembered to ask what they wanted. They seek an ordinary night of sleep with
    someone else keeping watch.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nOwn weapon damage gains 0.8%
    per companion body in the roster, before later balance modifiers.\r\n\nNamed
    talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not
    multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale
    separately at 1/2/4.\r\nSource: dream shop or special reward, subject to hero
    theme and unlock wave.\r\nBonds: astral, gear, hide. Immortal. Weapon rolls on
    recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids
    it."
